-- 2026-11-19: Sean's social direction after the 30-day analysis (playbook ve-social-schedule). Safe to run twice.
insert into playbook_records (slug, brand_slug, author, body, source, kind, created_at)
select 've-social-schedule', 'vegans-explore', 'Logan', $b$Direction from Sean 2026-11-19, after Logan's 30-day analysis (Metricool Oct 20 to Nov 19: followers flat, IG 3,768 to 3,769; the SoFlo Vegans "show is back" post reached 740, the only reel 336; Guide posts 12 to 70 with no likes; city launches 31 to 93). Sean: "we should be doing more posts that showcase the businesses, not so much the guides... the jury is still out on AI. So let's lead more with the faces of the people, and just keep taking note of the performance of our posts." (1) Faces first: real people and businesses lead; Guides only as the call to action. (2) Podcast clips that spotlight a business, organization or person, 30 to 45 s, pulled from episodes we already have, as standalone posts. (3) The 2-day rule: reach out to a featured business or person two days before, ask if they want to collaborate; never send a collab invite cold ("I don't like it when people just send me collaborations... It doesn't seem like we know what we're doing"). (4) Next Level Veggie Grill: no collab asks now; a post with them says "Next Level is officially on..." and shows them, run by their marketing team first; for now their focus is the holiday campaign. "Let's keep our ask to a minimum." Done the same hour: @nextlevelvg collaborator taken off the Austin (Nov 19), Denver (Nov 20) and Boston (Nov 21) launches, re-sent to Metricool (434236194, 434236604, 434236905), read back once each, no collaborator. (5) SoFlo Vegans (@soflovegans): Sean has been collaborating by hand; it carries all South Florida posts and anything we want amplified, never another chapter's posts. Not connected to the system yet; how to connect it is Sean's next decision. Targets proposed by Logan (not yet locked): 300 reach per IG feed post, 5% engagement, +100 IG followers a week.$b$, 'text', 'decision', now()
where not exists (select 1 from playbook_records where slug = 've-social-schedule' and body like 'Direction from Sean 2026-11-19%');
